{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>俄羅斯一名39歲的單親媽媽網紅，為了打造震撼的「真人芭比」形象，無視原主治醫師的嚴肅警告，硬砸下1.7萬英鎊（約17.7萬港元）遠赴比利時進行第六次隆乳手術。她將單側胸部植入高達2000cc的生理鹽水假體，使總胸圍容量衝上驚人的4公升，這起危險的整形奇聞曝光後立刻引發熱議。</p><p>據《太陽報》（The Sun）報導，這名來自葉卡捷琳堡（Yekaterinburg）的網紅安娜·丹尼洛娃（Anna Danilova）身材相當嬌小，前任整形醫師曾當面嚴詞拒絕她，警告其身形與窄胸框連一半大小的假體都難以負荷，但安娜仍執意圓夢。為此，她克服俄烏戰爭期間對俄國人的旅遊限制，毅然前往布魯塞爾找上另一名醫師，強行完成了這項超大容量的膨脹式鹽水袋植入手術。</p><figure><img alt=\"俄羅斯一名39歲的單親媽媽網紅，無視原主治醫師的嚴肅警告，遠赴比利時進行第六次隆乳手術（Instagram＠annushka_da）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188536722284220416896174.jpeg/9KkwVXWvQoVZmlEmWwy_UXdORyPGuOcC8vo3tPL6N7Q\"/><figcaption>俄羅斯一名39歲的單親媽媽網紅，無視原主治醫師的嚴肅警告，遠赴比利時進行第六次隆乳手術（Instagram＠annushka_da）</figcaption></figure><p>俄羅斯「真人芭比」Anna Danilova砸重金第6度隆乳　胸部飆至4公升：</p><figure><img alt=\"Anna Danilova整容前身材相當嬌小，前任整形醫師曾當面嚴詞拒絕她，警告其身形與窄胸框連一半大小的假體都難以負荷，但安娜仍執意圓夢。（East2West）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188536722103734272214673.png/SXcb-jud4KWrugUyTGghXHnM20_dSPZIQL7TZ0C-02c\"/><figcaption>Anna Danilova整容前身材相當嬌小，前任整形醫師曾當面嚴詞拒絕她，警告其身形與窄胸框連一半大小的假體都難以負荷，但安娜仍執意圓夢。（East2West）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"為此，她克服俄烏戰爭期間對俄國人的旅遊限制，毅然前往布魯塞爾找上另一名醫師，強行完成了這項超大容量的膨脹式鹽水袋植入手術。（Instagram＠annushka_da）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188536724641419264834169.png/9dk8B8yPn8AXKfIipOxKxZ8AZDcsMmF7KADexCgA3sQ\"/><figcaption>為此，她克服俄烏戰爭期間對俄國人的旅遊限制，毅然前往布魯塞爾找上另一名醫師，強行完成了這項超大容量的膨脹式鹽水袋植入手術。（Instagram＠annushka_da）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"安娜術後穿著醫用支撐胸罩自豪拍照，並驚呼胸部「緊繃到感覺快要爆炸」。（Instagram＠annushka_da）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188536727246213120927318.png/VylT2MbjWLs9sTRHQAtwaBZzyyppYTWqkA-nYpAPp2I\"/><figcaption>安娜術後穿著醫用支撐胸罩自豪拍照，並驚呼胸部「緊繃到感覺快要爆炸」。（Instagram＠annushka_da）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"她坦言，兩顆總重相當於7品脫（約4公升）的巨乳讓她苦不堪言，背部正承受著毀滅性的龐大壓力，但她仍沉浸在巨大上圍的滿足感中。（Instagram＠annushka_da）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188536729783898112894127.png/ExCxDlUJGvB6TKfCTt9NELqZUN55LsxPk-wB15PsAdc\"/><figcaption>她坦言，兩顆總重相當於7品脫（約4公升）的巨乳讓她苦不堪言，背部正承受著毀滅性的龐大壓力，但她仍沉浸在巨大上圍的滿足感中。（Instagram＠annushka_da）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"這股對胸部的瘋狂執念，源於她童年觀看美劇《沙灘拯救隊》對彭美拉安德遜（Pamela Anderson）的崇拜。（Instagram＠annushka_da）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188536731994427392657302.jpeg/QmJUnQHHc_WwGh2HaTNjW_l5Ky8PYTqtdcASA3XAEgM\"/><figcaption>這股對胸部的瘋狂執念，源於她童年觀看美劇《沙灘拯救隊》對彭美拉安德遜（Pamela Anderson）的崇拜。（Instagram＠annushka_da）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"與軍人丈夫離婚、暴瘦29kg後，她便踏上這條狂熱的改造之路，而此次天價手術費則由其50歲的比利時富豪未婚夫全額支付。（Instagram＠annushka_da）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188536719880753152507216.jpeg/K8iyNGW81UMVNmxcDCi8f3o-Tqdv7zNTWLsXc1i7F3M\"/><figcaption>與軍人丈夫離婚、暴瘦29kg後，她便踏上這條狂熱的改造之路，而此次天價手術費則由其50歲的比利時富豪未婚夫全額支付。（Instagram＠annushka_da）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Anna Danilova（Instagram＠annushka_da）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188536724515721216460217.jpeg/MNXU59CrBWukH6-vDgP9pBxey5U18Do-KpzqWyqc6ls\"/><figcaption>Anna Danilova（Instagram＠annushka_da）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Anna Danilova（Instagram＠annushka_da）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188536726860468224802537.jpeg/62t04D0c2-uroUzDV0hI3UAeuP9Q3jdvp6kiTKepIkw\"/><figcaption>Anna Danilova（Instagram＠annushka_da）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Anna Danilova（Instagram＠annushka_da）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188536729163272192074618.png/iKalKIdRInyS8BOA_XyzwNcp6HNMSPCncvRQtXL0ULU\"/><figcaption>Anna Danilova（Instagram＠annushka_da）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Anna Danilova（Instagram＠annushka_da）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261018/1188535309055299584283096.png/VZiuH_WQFweTss5C5i2ADBcKEMwYN6FZdwcosXcHKLE\"/><figcaption>Anna Danilova（Instagram＠annushka_da）</figcaption></figure><p>安娜術後穿著醫用支撐胸罩自豪拍照，並驚呼胸部「緊繃到感覺快要爆炸」。她坦言，兩顆總重相當於7品脫（約4公升）的巨乳讓她苦不堪言，背部正承受著毀滅性的龐大壓力，但她仍沉浸在巨大上圍的滿足感中。這股對胸部的瘋狂執念，源於她童年觀看美劇《沙灘拯救隊》對彭美拉安德遜Pamela Anderson）的崇拜。與軍人丈夫離婚、暴瘦29kg後，她便踏上這條狂熱的改造之路，而此次天價手術費則由其50歲的比利時富豪未婚夫全額支付。</p><p>她更透露，雖然假體理論上「可能會被炸得更大」，但她知道有些巨乳破裂的恐怖案例，因此暫時不想拿健康開玩笑冒險再灌水。不少網友還是感到震驚與不解，紛紛留言痛批：</p><p>「那一點也不性感，看起來簡直荒謬至極」</p><p>「它們看起來就很痛」</p><p>甚至直言這簡直是勸退大眾整形的最佳負面教材。</p><p>對於自己被外界指指點點，安娜堅稱自己並非怪胎，並未像其他網紅一樣注射危險的合成醇或進行極端骨骼整形，只是追求自己嚮往的美感。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：變形金剛女神美瑾霍絲驚傳臉部崩壞　最美容顏變安娜貝爾嚇壞網民】美瑾霍絲Megan Fox一度整張臉變形，讓人認不出來。（Letterboxd）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261012/1186254860467572736760243.png/H3qieA5xUY50z4NSbVs5Yob_iXJUGM7mijR2voo0dr4\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：變形金剛女神美瑾霍絲驚傳臉部崩壞　最美容顏變安娜貝爾嚇壞網民】美瑾霍絲Megan Fox一度整張臉變形，讓人認不出來。（Letterboxd）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Megan Fox成名作《變形金剛》中極經典一幕，相信大家都見慣見熟。（電影劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/4169488/org/171f9bb6491cc7cc214d16bc0b9455cb.jpg/DHW3Y5Ix554jjC4RofkyLPj8dNHQcFRlk5oXqJOaF6g\"/><figcaption>Megan Fox成名作《變形金剛》中極經典一幕，相信大家都見慣見熟。（電影劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243225620877312167045.jpeg/2p6GeAE_7sZwCGwXge304AImzLIVuWo2AOK95QDiveU\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243227944652800943581.jpeg/WNFL25rHwHOcfLr2O9siDXOiZrk-Nh_jSe7CIEnuwiA\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243222097530880287904.jpeg/0Fzce2lBOKfUC_ClV4ciceeOZNfCNOP5YdDr_mHQ6_4\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243217223618560517960.jpeg/5dE5NR6QMsxfwq1VaqQkF6AAB781iUneGbjpPhm46T4\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243219509514240679102.jpeg/fiFHPIglitn-pD5c2GXctwgNp0kPdKpFVQZZsVUGWbE\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243214190874624357920.jpeg/l1J1GFgY_zn0zeoLuEKCXIZGKqouvcwCk-kdpJPpHaQ\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243214870482944458129.jpeg/4bsvN3YiL5Di06PvVA0VywFPa_eSQtDXXPvc61z73Os\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243216732753920419058.jpeg/b3zdsTvXEOFuNEFpPKmnvNeeGO81IpXYacl3sGnJd7A\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243209161773056963421.jpeg/8Oi9mIbghnDeV-pc7xV_ZIyAOnIHmOhAY1GRC2NRkQs\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243211472834560093128.jpeg/VB5A4OX45TbZs8wrsES0jD1uAro9GsEW6Iiy1OiIstQ\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243212026613760460378.jpeg/kn6zKec8OvyZyZLrDlzYO8cxPwnuWkoY6sbk6-rG5Os\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243206653448192384562.jpeg/GcPyu3Wpi-VND8SwDvaGtT6blJpeNKfws6rSQ7Oq0kM\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243200768577536260879.jpeg/RQ-YZkHgq0QMDRJR-Vje7TY1zDF93SEudXx3lnV8d5Y\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230920/781243203499200512168307.jpeg/b1u21Uod-Lqf4_CcEtdG8nqPHCW3V020JNzQUiTc0FI\"/><figcaption>美瑾霍絲（Megan Fox）（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女星Megan Fox（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221112/668051397853450240468570.jpeg/--CrlK4Hk3gNatEVSn3Ahc1G1wTC1fcjpsPnBKbD5wQ\"/><figcaption>女星Megan Fox（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女星Megan Fox（IG@meganfox）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20221112/668051395257044992378920.jpeg/7mfAlB7hb0_wXh4mFmVPIxeXV0UXqG1Q5HUVhOR1FYQ\"/><figcaption>女星Megan Fox（IG@meganfox）</figcaption></figure><p>日酒店小姐Cos《獵人》伊耳謎爆紅 證件照「美到認不出來」網看傻</p><p>20歲女星陷不倫戀消失一年 今自爆「高一就懷孕」挨轟…小孩生父曝光</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T15:18:52.201104+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2111,"images":29,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:00:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T18:57:36.609789+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T15:17:36.122235+00:00","content_hash":"92f3e41ad03539f138ffac0432cd5d78d80f290e1274f1e750abc5bc9d9bfdc0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}